@startuml context
title CampusNav – Context (Moderate)
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam titleFontSize 16
skinparam noteFontSize 12
skinparam arrowColor #555555
skinparam legendBackgroundColor #F4F6F8
skinparam legendBorderColor #B8C2CC

actor User

rectangle "CampusNav" as App {
  [Map UI]
  [Search & Route Panel]
}

cloud "Mapbox Platform" as Mapbox
node "Browser Geolocation API" as Geo

User --> App
App --> Mapbox : map tiles, styles
App --> Geo : location watch

note bottom of App
Client-only React SPA:
Local routing + search.
External only: Map tiles, geolocation.
end note

legend right
User->App: interact
App->Mapbox: tiles/styles
App->Geo: position
end legend

@enduml
